WEBVTT

NOTE Actual app components with demonstration data. No real sends.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Transcript import — demonstration

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:10.102
Import a transcript from CME Credits.

2
00:00:10.102 --> 00:00:17.219
Choose a supported file or paste text.

3
00:00:17.219 --> 00:00:25.902
If prompted, match the columns, then review the selected rows.

4
00:00:25.902 --> 00:00:32.237
Duplicates begin unticked.

5
00:00:32.237 --> 00:00:40.643
Check dates, hours and credit types and correct missing fields.

6
00:00:40.643 --> 00:00:47.804
Nothing enters the log until you add the batch.

7
00:00:47.804 --> 00:00:56.800
Afterward, link individual certificates from Documents if you need them.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.000
Try it with your own records. Review the result.
